  "description": "What gives?! Lady Doreen Bradshaw is wise enough to make her father a fortune with her investments but not old enough to legally make any choices for herself! On top of that, it seems every adult in her life either sees her as a golden goose or a beautiful bride-to-be. Is the fluctuating price of Lady Doreen’s freedom something not even the genius herself can predict?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
